  pages:
  - screenshot: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1da884bb810dc2c408e6b340c781e162, type: 3}
    title: Quest Notification
    body: 'Whenever you receive a quest, complete a quest, or fail a quest, you will
      see a notification like this with the name of the quest and the actions either
      that need to be completed, have been completed, or have failed to be completed. '
  - screenshot: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9f3da548b917c9c4480e4cc0006daee8, type: 3}
    title: Different Colors
    body: "The band on the left of the notification has a color that corresponds
      to different meanings. \nBlue means it's a new quest, Green means you completed
      a quest, and Red means you failed a quest."
  - screenshot: {fileID: -7469096589320162694, guid: b6ced1d421ed0754090ca1ed96fbdb2b, type: 3}
    title: Tracker Panel
    body: You can check on the status of your quests by hovering your cursor over
      the quest tracking panel.
  - screenshot: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d53e4a9e966553b46aee1a0a693a216c, type: 3}
    title: Log Panel
    body: Clicking on a quest opens up this quest panel UI where you can see more
      information about the quest.
